# Grocery preferences & product experiences

This file is the skill's long-term memory. Read it before comparing shops or suggesting substitutions, and append to it after the user makes decisions. Keep entries short and dated (YYYY-MM-DD).

> This is the template. On first use, copy it to `preferences.md` (which is gitignored — your
> personal preferences stay local):  `cp preferences.md.example preferences.md`

